# The climb's state is not repo content.
#
# The operating agent writes every round into .foundry/ — the spec it is
# climbing, the atlas of tells, the hash-chained bus, judge briefs, answer
# keys, verdicts, scores, sourced reference bytes, emitted artifacts. All of
# it is one foundry's findings, and none of it is the instrument.
#
# Tracking it was how this repo got to 63% state by line count. A clone should
# carry the machinery and start its own climb.
/.foundry/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.DS_Store
